        {
          "id": 2060488539,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The clang analyzer warning addresses the case when the GAL even and odd page within the same UBX-RXM-SFRBX messages are of different types (nominal vs. alert type) as, indeed, the code for data word handoff assumes that both, the even and the odd page are of nominal type. While I believe both pages are always of the same type, I have created a separate merge request to ensure that the handoff is only done when it is the case, see merge request 16910.",
